WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:16.000
A bank, building society or credit union account. Email and phone. An identity document (a passport, for example). Details of your home and rent. Payslips, savings and other benefits you receive. Your National Insurance number, if you have one.

2
00:00:16.000 --> 00:00:32.000
1. Create your online account and finish the claim within 28 days (otherwise you start again). 2. The payment counts from the day you submit the claim. 3. Verify your identity online or at an appointment.

3
00:00:32.000 --> 00:00:48.000
4. Couples who live together make a joint claim. 5. If you cannot do it online: Universal Credit helpline 0800 328 5644, free, Monday to Friday 8am to 6pm. 6. Free help: Citizens Advice «Help to Claim».

4
00:00:48.000 --> 00:00:55.200
Now do the lesson exercises. If you are unsure, watch this video again.
